Description: panvk/jm: allow indirect and indexed draws without vertex buffers
 With no vertex buffer bound, the zero-sized attribute buffer info
 allocation returns no memory and the draw failed with
 VK_ERROR_OUT_OF_DEVICE_MEMORY. Only require it when there are buffers.
Author: pocket-debs
Origin: https://github.com/masterxq/mesa-lisbon (branch lisbon/26.3)
Forwarded: no
License: MIT (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/jm/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/jm/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c
index 7df80b33d1b..b0dc7c3427c 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/jm/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/jm/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c
@@ -636,7 +636,7 @@ panvk_draw_prepare_vs_attribs(struct panvk_cmd_buffer *cmdbuf,
          cmdbuf, desc,
          num_vs_attribs * sizeof(struct libpan_draw_helper_attrib_info), 8);
 
-      if (!bufs_infos_storage.gpu ||
+      if ((num_vbs && !bufs_infos_storage.gpu) ||
           (num_vs_attribs && !attribs_infos_storage.gpu))
          return VK_ERROR_OUT_OF_DEVICE_MEMORY;
 
